{"id":"43afe63c-e5e5-4d2b-8436-12c9703d7ba7","revision":0,"last_node_id":62,"last_link_id":95,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-430],"size":[4700,380],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Arbor · Continuous shots from one storyboard sheet — MOSS-Image + FastH3 OmniRef (MiniMax H3, 8 steps)\n\nMOSS-Image draws the whole storyboard as **one picture** — six panels of one moment — so the character, the light and the palette match from frame to frame far better than six separate renders. **Split Grid** cuts the sheet into six keyframes, and FastH3 OmniRef turns them into five clips that run into each other: clip 1 goes from keyframe 1 to keyframe 2, clip 2 from 2 to 3, and so on.\n\n1. **Storyboard sheet**: one prompt asks for *six panels, three columns and two rows, thin white gutters, no text* and describes every panel. The sheet is 3264 × 1216 (4 MP, the six 16:9 panels side by side ≈ 8:3), so each panel is about 1080 × 600. MOSS-Image SFT, 50 steps, cfg 3.\n2. **Split Grid** (2 rows × 3 columns) finds the gutters — a drawn grid is never quite even — and gives the panels in reading order.\n3. **List Item** `:-1` takes every keyframe but the last (the first frames), `1:` every keyframe but the first (the last frames); **Tree to Data** lines the pairs up.\n4. Each pair goes into **MiniMax H3 Reference to Video** as `<Picture 1>` and `<Picture 2>`, and two **Add Guide** nodes pin them to the first (0) and the last frame (-1). **Prompt Template** (*zip*) writes one structured prompt per transition from a **motion** and a **sound** line — five each, in order — and **Length** gives every transition its own duration in frames at 24 fps (17k + 5: 107 ≈ 4.5 s, 124 ≈ 5 s, 141, 158, 175 ≈ 7.3 s), so the slow beats can breathe. Keep **Model Sparse Attention** on *vsa* (keep 10 %) and **SigmaShift** at 12 / 3.\n5. Clip *k* ends on the keyframe clip *k + 1* starts on, so joined as they are the keyframe would show twice. **Batch Pick** `1:` drops the first frame of every clip and **Trim Audio** the same 1/24 s, so the sequence runs straight through.\n6. **Save by Path** writes the clips with their names (`output/arbor/h3_continuous/01 → 02.mp4 …`) and **Concatenate Video** joins them into one sequence with sound.\n\nNot every seed draws a clean grid: check the sheet, change the seed if panels merge. Another layout: change *rows* / *columns* on Split Grid, the size and the panel list in the prompt, and give n − 1 motion and sound lines. Your own keyframes: connect a **Load Media** to the two List Items instead of Split Grid."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Arbor · Continuous shots from one storyboard sheet — MOSS-Image + FastH3 OmniRef (MiniMax H3, 8 steps)\n\nMOSS-Image draws the whole storyboard as **one picture** — six panels of one moment — so the character, the light and the palette match from frame to frame far better than six separate renders. **Split Grid** cuts the sheet into six keyframes, and FastH3 OmniRef turns them into five clips that run into each other: clip 1 goes from keyframe 1 to keyframe 2, clip 2 from 2 to 3, and so on.\n\n1. **Storyboard sheet**: one prompt asks for *six panels, three columns and two rows, thin white gutters, no text* and describes every panel. The sheet is 3264 × 1216 (4 MP, the six 16:9 panels side by side ≈ 8:3), so each panel is about 1080 × 600. MOSS-Image SFT, 50 steps, cfg 3.\n2. **Split Grid** (2 rows × 3 columns) finds the gutters — a drawn grid is never quite even — and gives the panels in reading order.\n3. **List Item** `:-1` takes every keyframe but the last (the first frames), `1:` every keyframe but the first (the last frames); **Tree to Data** lines the pairs up.\n4. Each pair goes into **MiniMax H3 Reference to Video** as `<Picture 1>` and `<Picture 2>`, and two **Add Guide** nodes pin them to the first (0) and the last frame (-1). **Prompt Template** (*zip*) writes one structured prompt per transition from a **motion** and a **sound** line — five each, in order — and **Length** gives every transition its own duration in frames at 24 fps (17k + 5: 107 ≈ 4.5 s, 124 ≈ 5 s, 141, 158, 175 ≈ 7.3 s), so the slow beats can breathe. Keep **Model Sparse Attention** on *vsa* (keep 10 %) and **SigmaShift** at 12 / 3.\n5. Clip *k* ends on the keyframe clip *k + 1* starts on, so joined as they are the keyframe would show twice. **Batch Pick** `1:` drops the first frame of every clip and **Trim Audio** the same 1/24 s, so the sequence runs straight through.\n6. **Save by Path** writes the clips with their names (`output/arbor/h3_continuous/01 → 02.mp4 …`) and **Concatenate Video** joins them into one sequence with sound.\n\nNot every seed draws a clean grid: check the sheet, change the seed if panels merge. Another layout: change *rows* / *columns* on Split Grid, the size and the panel list in the prompt, and give n − 1 motion and sound lines. Your own keyframes: connect a **Load Media** to the two List Items instead of Split Grid."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":3,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[1240,0],"size":[420,400],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[56]}],"title":"Motion · one line per transition","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["The camera glides in along the wooden pier toward her; she lifts the paper lantern and strikes a match, and a small flame catches inside.\nThe camera pushes in to a close-up as the flame grows; warm light fills the thin paper and spreads across her face as she raises the lantern.\nThe camera tilts up as she lifts the glowing lantern above her head and lets it go; it rises just past her open fingertips.\nThe camera cranes back behind her as the lantern drifts up over the lake to join the others, their reflections shimmering on the water.\nThe camera rises high above the lake as hundreds of lanterns float up into the starry sky; the pier and her silhouette grow small below.",false,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"The camera glides in along the wooden pier toward her; she lifts the paper lantern and strikes a match, and a small flame catches inside.\nThe camera pushes in to a close-up as the flame grows; warm light fills the thin paper and spreads across her face as she raises the lantern.\nThe camera tilts up as she lifts the glowing lantern above her head and lets it go; it rises just past her open fingertips.\nThe camera cranes back behind her as the lantern drifts up over the lake to join the others, their reflections shimmering on the water.\nThe camera rises high above the lake as hundreds of lanterns float up into the starry sky; the pier and her silhouette grow small below.","parse_numbers":false,"multiline":false,"arbor_panel":""}},{"id":4,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[1240,440],"size":[420,230],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[57]}],"title":"Sound · one line per transition","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["Water lapping softly against the pier, a light evening breeze, the scratch and flare of a match.\nThe soft crackle of the flame, thin paper rustling, crickets along the shore.\nA gentle rush of warm air, a quiet breath, still water.\nWind over the lake, faint distant voices of people releasing lanterns.\nA soft night breeze, a distant temple bell, the hush of the lake at night.",false,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"Water lapping softly against the pier, a light evening breeze, the scratch and flare of a match.\nThe soft crackle of the flame, thin paper rustling, crickets along the shore.\nA gentle rush of warm air, a quiet breath, still water.\nWind over the lake, faint distant voices of people releasing lanterns.\nA soft night breeze, a distant temple bell, the hush of the lake at night.","parse_numbers":false,"multiline":false,"arbor_panel":""}},{"id":8,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[2140,0],"size":[400,910],"flags":{},"order":20,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":59},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null}],"title":"Prompts per transition (live)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["",true,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"","parse_numbers":true,"multiline":false,"arbor_panel":""}},{"id":12,"type":"CLIPLoader","pos":[2620,520],"size":[340,106],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP名称","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"类型","name":"type","type"